    "title": "Top Cancer Doc Lands In Cincy, Takes Charge At UC Cancer Center - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hazel Ramirez ,\n9 hours ago Starting today, Dr. David Gius is officially in the driver’s seat at the University of Cincinnati Cancer Center after a national search that drew leaders from top research programs across the country. A radiation oncologist and physician-scientist, Gius is known for translational work that links aging and metabolism to cancer biology. His arrival is the most visible step so far in the center’s multi-year effort to grow clinical trials and specialty cancer care for patients across the region. Read full article\n7",
